{"id":"A1-L077","title":"Prepositions of place: practice and contrast","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U05","focus":"Prepositions of place — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Prepositions of place — prática e contraste","pron":"r americano","verbs":["practice"],"pv":["come in"],"expr":[],"words":["study group","reading room","cafeteria","train","noise","comfortable","study spot","library table","study desk","noise-free","good light","bus ride","study habits","reading corner"],"field":"Trabalho","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Leitura","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 77 · Prepositions of place: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Prepositions of place — prática e contraste.","**Verbos:** practice.","**Phrasal verbs:** come in.","**Pronúncia:** r americano.","**14 palavras novas** (trabalho).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo contrastar in, on, at e usar come in e practice."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["study group","study group"],["reading room","reading room"],["cafeteria","cafeteria"],["train","train"],["noise","noise"],["comfortable","comfortable"],["study spot","study spot"],["library table","library table"],["study desk","study desk"],["noise-free","noise-free"],["good light","good light"],["bus ride","bus ride"],["study habits","study habits"],["reading corner","reading corner"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Where Should We Study?","paras":["Some students study **at** home, others **in** the library, and a few **on** the bus. The best place is quiet and bright.","**Come in** and sit **at** the big table, put your bag **under** the chair, and **practice** every day. Small habits **in** a good place win."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"The Student Voice","gloss":[["best","melhor"],["bright","claro"],["habit","hábito"],["win","vencer"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The best place is quiet.","ans":"T","why":"“quiet and bright.”"},{"q":"Students study only at home.","ans":"F","why":"Vários lugares."},{"q":"The writer says: practice every day.","ans":"T","why":"“practice every day.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“best” means…","opts":["melhor","pior","novo"],"ans":0,"why":"best."},{"q":"“come in” means…","opts":["entre","saia","espere"],"ans":0,"why":"come in."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"in / on / at: contrast","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Preposição","Lugar","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**in**","espaço fechado, cidade","**in the library, in Rio**"],["**on**","superfície, transporte","**on the table, on the bus**"],["**at**","ponto/endereço","**at home, at school, at the door**"]],"cap":"in / on / at: contrast"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Dica: **at** para eventos e pontos (*at work*); **in** para espaços (*in the room*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I study ___ home. (at/in)","a":"at","why":"at home."},{"s":"I read ___ the bus. (on/in)","a":"on","why":"transporte."},{"s":"She sits ___ the library. (in/at)","a":"in","why":"espaço."},{"s":"___ in and sit down. (Come)","a":"Come","why":"come in."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["library","biblioteca"],["best","melhor"],["habit","hábito"],["practice","praticar"],["quiet","silencioso"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["come","in","Can","I"],"ans":"Can I come in","pt":"Posso entrar?"},{"words":["in","Sure","come"],"ans":"Sure come in","pt":"Claro, entre."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"study group","pos":"word","pt":"study group","ex":"grupo de estudo","expt":"Join a study group."},{"w":"reading room","pos":"word","pt":"reading room","ex":"sala de leitura","expt":"A reading room."},{"w":"cafeteria","pos":"word","pt":"cafeteria","ex":"refeitório","expt":"The school cafeteria."},{"w":"train","pos":"word","pt":"train","ex":"trem","expt":"Read on the train."},{"w":"noise","pos":"word","pt":"noise","ex":"barulho","expt":"Too much noise."},{"w":"comfortable","pos":"word","pt":"comfortable","ex":"confortável","expt":"A comfortable chair."},{"w":"study spot","pos":"word","pt":"study spot","ex":"lugar de estudo","expt":"A quiet study spot."},{"w":"library table","pos":"word","pt":"library table","ex":"mesa de biblioteca","expt":"A library table."},{"w":"study desk","pos":"word","pt":"study desk","ex":"escrivaninha","expt":"A study desk."},{"w":"noise-free","pos":"word","pt":"noise-free","ex":"sem barulho","expt":"A noise-free place."},{"w":"good light","pos":"word","pt":"good light","ex":"boa iluminação","expt":"Good light helps."},{"w":"bus ride","pos":"word","pt":"bus ride","ex":"viagem de ônibus","expt":"A short bus ride."},{"w":"study habits","pos":"word","pt":"study habits","ex":"hábitos de estudo","expt":"Good study habits."},{"w":"reading corner","pos":"word","pt":"reading corner","ex":"cantinho de leitura","expt":"A reading corner."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Where do you study?** — Onde você estuda?","**At the library.** — Na biblioteca.","**Can I come in?** — Posso entrar?","**I’ll take care of it.** — Eu cuido disso.","**It’s on the house.** — É por conta da casa.","**That’s very kind of you.** — É muito gentil da sua parte."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"practice","pt":"praticar","forms":[["I / you / we / they practice","I practice every day."],["he / she / it practices","She practices English."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**come in**","entrar","Come in, please. — Entre, por favor."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Study spot","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Study spot","lines":[["Ana","Where do you study?","Onde você estuda?"],["Leo","At the library.","Na biblioteca."],["Ana","Can I come in?","Posso entrar?"],["Leo","Sure, come in.","Claro, entre."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: r americano","items":[{"label":"r americano","note":"O r americano: língua curvada para trás, sem tocar o céu da boca.","words":["red","right","run","read","road","rice"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say where you study.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I study at home."},{"q":"Invite someone in.","pt":"Convide.","model":"Come in, please."},{"q":"Say what you practice.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I practice English every day."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with in, on, at.","model":"I study at home. I read on the bus. I work in an office. I sit at the big table. Come in!","checklist":["Usei **in/on/at**","Usei **come in**","Usei **practice**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “library” mean?","opts":["melhor","biblioteca","praticar"],"ans":1,"why":"**library** = biblioteca."},{"q":"What does “best” mean?","opts":["hábito","silencioso","melhor"],"ans":2,"why":"**best** = melhor."},{"q":"What does “habit” mean?","opts":["hábito","praticar","claro"],"ans":0,"why":"**habit** = hábito."},{"q":"What does “practice” mean?","opts":["silencioso","praticar","mesa"],"ans":1,"why":"**practice** = praticar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}